      `Official video created by Simon Ward for 1d3ntity (https://identity-media.co.uk).`,
      `Kings of Mercia are: Jim Matheos (Guitars), Steve Overland (Vocals), Simon Phillips (Drums), Joey Vera (Bass).`,
