      `Kings of Mercia are: Jim Matheos (Guitars), Steve Overland (Vocals), Simon Phillips (Drums), Joey Vera (Bass).`,
      `Published by Metal Blade Records. Buy the album at metalblade.com/kingsofmercia`,
    ],
  },
  {
    title: `"Don't Ask" (Official Video)`,
    album: 'Battle Scars (2024)',
    videoId: '0TKImWS11VY',
    notes: [
      `"Don't Ask" is the first single released from the 2024 album "Battle Scars".`,
      `“Don’t Ask” is described by singer Steve Overland as an “angsty love song” with lyrics including: “You could believe in anything you wanted to believe; We were all free to be whatever we wanted to be.”`,
      `“We found our feet with this album. This is the Kings of Mercia evolving. People think you can pigeonhole rock music fans, but they just like good songs and good music,” Overland says.`,
      `Official video created by Simon Ward for 1d3ntity (https://identity-media.co.uk).`,
      `Kings of Mercia are: Jim Matheos (Guitars), Steve Overland (Vocals), Simon Phillips (Drums), Joey Vera (Bass).`,
      `Published by Metal Blade Records. Buy the album at metalblade.com/kingsofmercia`,
    ],
  },
  {
    title: `"Humankind" (Bass Playthrough Video)`,
