      `Kings of Mercia are: Jim Matheos (Guitars), Steve Overland (Vocals), Simon Phillips (Drums), Joey Vera (Bass).`,
      `Published by Metal Blade Records. Buy the album at metalblade.com/kingsofmercia`,
    ],
  },
  {
    title: `"Set the World on Fire" (Guitar Playthrough Video)`,
    album: 'Kings of Mercia (2022)',
    videoId: '5Dj2n0CTpf8',
    notes: [
      `Jim Matheos performs "Set the World on Fire" from Kings of Mercia's self-titled debut album.`,
      `Editing by Chris Anderson.`,
      `Kings of Mercia are: Jim Matheos (Guitars), Steve Overland (Vocals), Simon Phillips (Drums), Joey Vera (Bass).`,
